- No room for the defiler of the corn!


00:22:43.894 --> 00:22:46.454
- No vacancy!
- Wha


00:22:46.497 --> 00:22:49.466
No room for the homosexual!
No vacancy.


00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:51.593
