00:22:51.635 --> 00:22:54.365
What did he say about the corn?


00:22:54.405 --> 00:22:58.171
- I wasn't paying attention.
- He said something about the corn.


00:22:58.209 --> 00:23:01.770
I know he did
something weird.


00:23:10.755 --> 00:23:12.416
Hey hey!


00:23:12.456 --> 00:23:14.151
There is life in Nebraska.


00:23:26.303 --> 00:23:28.464
Are you sure anyone is here?


00:23:28.506 --> 00:23:31.407
It doesn't matter.
I just wanna use the pay phone.


00:23:31.442 --> 00:23:34.843
I have to report this... murder.


00:23:36.647 --> 00:23:38.615
Are you all right?


00:23:38.649 --> 00:23:40.674
Yeah. Yeah, I will be...


00:23:40.718 --> 00:23:44.245
as soon as we're 1,000 miles
away from here.


00:23:44.288 --> 00:23:47.223
Sunny and sinful California.


00:23:47.258 --> 00:23:51.126
The Rocky Mountains
between us and Nebraska.


00:23:52.930 --> 00:23:55.490
You got any change?


00:23:55.533 --> 00:23:57.296
Nope.


00:23:57.334 --> 00:24:00.098
I'll just dial the emergency operator.


00:24:47.685 --> 00:24:50.245
We'll be in town
in a few minutes.


00:25:00.731 --> 00:25:03.495
Looks like folks
in Gatlin got religion.


00:25:03.534 --> 00:25:06.731
I thought all folks
in Nebraska had religion.


00:25:06.770 --> 00:25:09.136
It sure sounds
