00:25:47.444 --> 00:25:49.810
- Got it.
- Attagirl.


00:25:52.950 --> 00:25:55.384
A shirt...


00:25:55.419 --> 00:25:57.444
a belt...


00:25:59.490 --> 00:26:01.583
What is this?


00:26:01.625 --> 00:26:04.093
That's a real golden oldie.


00:26:04.128 --> 00:26:06.426
Huh.


00:26:08.799 --> 00:26:12.098
Anything strikes you as funny
about that radio sermon?


00:26:13.537 --> 00:26:16.768
