instead of praying for them.


00:26:26.817 --> 00:26:29.308
I had enough of that religious crap
to last me forever.


00:26:30.321 --> 00:26:32.118
I told you about it.


00:26:32.156 --> 00:26:35.216
Yeah, but didn't this preacher
sound young?


00:26:35.259 --> 00:26:38.228
A teenager, maybe, but that's what's
so monstrous about their whole trip.


00:26:38.262 --> 00:26:40.822
They like to get them
while their minds are still rubber,


00:26:40.864 --> 00:26:44.322
and all the emotional checks
and balances to put in.


00:26:44.368 --> 00:26:47.132
You should've seen
some of the ones I got saved by.


00:26:47.171 --> 00:26:49.503
Let's see, there was...


00:26:49.540 --> 00:26:51.838
Baby Hortense,


00:26:51.875 --> 00:26:54.002
