She was eight.


00:26:54.044 --> 00:26:56.376
She'd come on singing
"Leaning on the Everlasting Arms"


00:26:56.413 --> 00:26:58.813
while her daddy passed the plate,
telling everybody to


00:26:58.849 --> 00:27:01.579
"Dig deep now, brothers and sisters.


00:27:01.619 --> 00:27:04.110
Let's not let
this blessed child down.


00:27:04.154 --> 00:27:07.419
She does the work of our Lord,
the son of God."


00:27:07.458 --> 00:27:09.153
Jesus.


00:27:10.394 --> 00:27:13.522
- Oh my God!


00:27:14.798 --> 00:27:18.256
It's just


00:27:22.172 --> 00:27:25.266
Wow. It's a fantastic piece
of workmanship.


00:27:25.309 --> 00:27:28.301
Real American primitive.


00:27:28.345 --> 00:27:30.438
It's hideous.


00:27:30.481 --> 00:27:33.917
- It's a blasphemy. Throw it out.
- No, the police will want to see this.


00:27:33.951 --> 00:27:36.545
- Why?
- I don't know. Evidence, maybe.


00:27:36.587 --> 00:27:39.283
Just throw it out!
Will you do that for me?


00:27:39.323 --> 00:27:41.587
Just throw it out.
I don't want it in the car.


00:27:42.593 --> 00:27:45.391
All right. I'll tell you what
we'll put it all in the back for now.


00:27:45.429 --> 00:27:47.727
As soon as we see the cops,
we give 'em everything


00:27:47.765 --> 00:27:51.064
the body, the whole works.
And we'll be done with it, all right?


00:27:51.101 --> 00:27:53.467
Do what you want, okay?


00:27:59.476 --> 00:28:00.909
You will, anyway.


00:28:09.553 --> 00:28:12.852
Behold...


00:28:12.890 --> 00:28:16.917
a dream that come to me
in the night.


00:28:16.960 --> 00:28:19.622
And in my dream
the Lord was a shadow


00:28:19.663 --> 00:28:22.393
that walked behind the rows.


00:28:22.433 --> 00:28:26.096
And God spoke to me as he has
spoken to our older brothers


00:28:26.136 --> 00:28:28.764
since we children started
making sacrifice.


00:28:28.806 --> 00:28:32.708
Praise God.
Praise the Lord.


00:28:32.743 --> 00:28:35.507
And God told me all
that has happened since.


00:28:35.546 --> 00:28:37.207
God said to me,


00:28:37.247 --> 00:28:41.206
"Joseph will take his things
and flee this happy place


00:28:41.251 --> 00:28:44.243
because the fear of me
is no more upon him.


00:28:44.288 --> 00:28:47.917
So take of his life
in punishment, not sacrifice.


00:28:47.958 --> 00:28:50.392
Let not his flesh pollute the corn,


00:28:50.427 --> 00:28:52.793
but cast his body upon the road.


00:28:52.830 --> 00:28:55.230
So thus evermore will Joseph,


00:28:55.265 --> 00:28:57.290
the betrayer of the corn,


00:28:57.334 --> 00:29:00.565
be known as Ahaz, cursed of God."


00:29:00.604 --> 00:29:04.335
Yea, so it is, Joseph, the unbeliever.


00:29:04.374 --> 00:29:06.968
Yea, Ahaz be cursed.


00:29:07.010 --> 00:29:09.001
And the Lord did say,


00:29:09.046 --> 00:29:12.607
"l will send outlanders among you
a man and a woman


00:29:12.649 --> 00:29:17.348
and these unbelievers will be
profaners and defilers of the corn.


00:29:17.387 --> 00:29:20.618
Then shall your faith be tested
as it was in the days of the blue man."


00:29:20.657 --> 00:29:23.125
The blue man.


00:29:23.160 --> 00:29:25.355
Yea, the blue man.


00:29:26.530 --> 00:29:30.432
He Who Walks Behind The Rows
has protected us from the outside world


00:29:30.467 --> 00:29:34.301
and provided for us since
the oldest amongst us were little.


00:29:34.338 --> 00:29:37.364
But a time of tribulation has come.


00:29:37.407 --> 00:29:39.602
A test is at hand!


00:29:39.643 --> 00:29:41.008
We welcome the test.


00:29:41.044 --> 00:29:43.945
You should not show pride,
