My power is great.


00:30:00.731 --> 00:30:02.790
I'm the Lord of lords,


00:30:02.833 --> 00:30:05.165
so now you must make
sacrifices to me


00:30:05.202 --> 00:30:09.002
and behold the unbelievers
who've come to fulfill this purpose."


00:30:10.174 --> 00:30:12.665
Make sacrifice.


00:30:12.709 --> 00:30:14.870
Yea!


00:30:16.280 --> 00:30:19.306
Thus shall it be with the outlanders.


00:30:19.349 --> 00:30:22.284
This is the word
of He Who Walks Behind The Rows.


00:30:22.319 --> 00:30:25.049
We do his work
from shine to shadow.


00:30:25.088 --> 00:30:26.715
It is well we do this.


00:30:26.757 --> 00:30:29.749
- Yea, verily.
- Amen.


00:30:38.302 --> 00:30:40.896
- Do you smell that?
- Yeah.


00:30:40.938 --> 00:30:42.701
What stinks?


00:30:42.739 --> 00:30:45.708
