having a bake sale or something.


00:32:08.725 --> 00:32:11.353
There's no one here.


00:32:11.395 --> 00:32:13.829
- Do you remember that gas station?
- Yeah, what about it?


00:32:13.864 --> 00:32:18.767
When was the last time you paid
35.9¢ for gas in this country?


00:32:18.802 --> 00:32:21.202
The '60s, maybe.


00:32:21.238 --> 00:32:24.207
We're in the middle of town
and I haven't seen one car moving


00:32:24.241 --> 00:32:26.334
not one car!


00:32:29.913 --> 00:32:31.847
Where are you
where are you going?


00:32:31.882 --> 00:32:33.406
I'm gonna go pull
that hair out of your ass.


00:32:33.450 --> 00:32:36.817
I'm gonna go see where everybody is.
The sign says "Open." I'm going in.


00:32:36.853 --> 00:32:40.220
And you're just gonna leave me
alone in the car again, huh?


00:32:40.257 --> 00:32:43.715
You said you wanted
an early lunch stop. Congratulations.


00:32:43.760 --> 00:32:47.719
You've got it. And no talking about
