00:33:18.295 --> 00:33:20.593
Hmm?


00:33:21.598 --> 00:33:23.691
Look,


00:33:23.734 --> 00:33:25.565
- do you hear it?
- Hear what?


00:33:25.602 --> 00:33:29.163
The nothing. There are no cars.
