The whole place stinks of it.


00:35:11.141 --> 00:35:12.768
I'm sorry.


00:35:12.809 --> 00:35:15.710
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. Um


00:35:15.745 --> 00:35:18.612
Why don't we just go find
some local authorities


00:35:18.648 --> 00:35:21.344
