00:35:23.019 --> 00:35:24.680
Okay?


00:35:24.721 --> 00:35:26.382
No.


00:35:26.423 --> 00:35:29.119
- What?
- No.


00:35:29.159 --> 00:35:31.650
There, I said it. No!


00:35:31.695 --> 00:35:34.858
And in a nutshell, why our entire
