00:38:23.667 --> 00:38:25.532
Something's happened in this town...


00:38:26.536 --> 00:38:28.800
something wrong.


00:38:28.838 --> 00:38:31.204
In a crisis,
they all collect at the church.


00:38:32.442 --> 00:38:35.502
- "He Who Walks Behind The Rows"?
- Yeah.


00:38:35.545 --> 00:38:39.743
Just one of 9,000 different names
for God in Nebraska, I guess.


00:38:40.750 --> 00:38:43.719
I'm gonna go take a look.
Join me?


00:38:44.921 --> 00:38:47.389
I'm not going in there with you.


00:38:47.424 --> 00:38:50.018
Fine. Do whatever you want.


00:38:52.562 --> 00:38:54.496
I haven't been in a church
