00:38:54.531 --> 00:38:57.091
I don't wanna be in this church,
I don't wanna be in this town


00:38:57.133 --> 00:38:59.397
and can we just go?!


00:38:59.436 --> 00:39:02.098
I'm just gonna go in
for 10 minutes tops.


00:39:02.138 --> 00:39:04.572
