00:39:15.418 --> 00:39:18.046
If you're not back out here,
I'm gonna drive away.


00:39:19.055 --> 00:39:22.024
All right.
No more games.


00:39:22.058 --> 00:39:26.085
I'm gonna tell you that once
no more games.


00:39:26.129 --> 00:39:29.428
No games.
10 minutes,


00:39:29.466 --> 00:39:32.435
