Just mug me, take my keys?


00:39:44.714 --> 00:39:47.410
- No, but you think that I would.
- Yeah.


00:39:47.450 --> 00:39:49.281
I think you're
just about capable of that.


00:39:49.319 --> 00:39:51.287
- Yeah?
- Yeah.


00:39:52.622 --> 00:39:55.614
- Give me the bag. Give me the bag!
- Give it to me, you son of a bitch!


00:39:55.658 --> 00:39:57.353
Give me my purse!
Give it to


00:39:57.394 --> 00:39:59.726
- my give me my purse!
- Give me give me the bag!


00:40:07.103 --> 00:40:09.162
Oh, look who has
all the coins in Nebraska.


00:40:09.205 --> 00:40:12.140
You did not have to do that.


00:40:12.175 --> 00:40:15.542
