God is my strength.


01:17:49.864 --> 01:17:52.594
It was He Who Walks
Behind The Rows.


01:17:56.037 --> 01:17:59.097
The blue man. Yea, the blue man.


01:18:11.252 --> 01:18:13.914
It's due west
back to the highway, right?


01:18:13.954 --> 01:18:15.615
Right.


01:18:21.328 --> 01:18:23.023
I'll hitch a ride.


01:18:23.064 --> 01:18:25.589
I'll make
some phone calls.


01:18:27.635 --> 01:18:30.798
Which way is it
back to the road?


01:18:32.239 --> 01:18:35.470
Okay, I can go west by the stars.


01:18:36.711 --> 01:18:38.440
I went on 61 patrols.


01:18:38.479 --> 01:18:41.277
- I came back from every one of them.


01:18:44.785 --> 01:18:46.309
'Cause I've got
a compass in my head.


01:18:46.353 --> 01:18:49.413
I'm gonna get out.
I'm gonna get out of here.


01:18:51.425 --> 01:18:54.394
- Stop talking to yourself.


01:18:54.428 --> 01:18:56.089
Stop talking to yourself.


01:21:32.786 --> 01:21:35.050
Oh my God.


01:21:35.089 --> 01:21:36.954
Oh my God!


01:21:36.991 --> 01:21:39.516
Oh my God.


01:21:39.560 --> 01:21:42.791
Vicky. Vicky.


01:22:00.314 --> 01:22:01.838
Who's there?


01:22:01.882 --> 01:22:04.874
- Who's there?!


01:22:06.186 --> 01:22:09.053
Come out where I can see you,
you black pajama'd bastards!


01:22:13.827 --> 01:22:17.490
Come out here!
Come out here and look at me!


01:22:43.991 --> 01:22:46.459
Hey, Burt.


01:22:46.493 --> 01:22:50.554
Come on, it's not so bad.


01:22:50.597 --> 01:22:53.566
Being sacrificed by devil
pagan children in the corn


01:22:53.600 --> 01:22:56.194
- it's not so bad.


01:22:58.072 --> 01:23:00.700
Having your eyes ripped
out of your skull,


01:23:00.741 --> 01:23:02.402
- according to the laws of Moses


01:23:02.443 --> 01:23:04.809
it's not so bad.


01:23:04.845 --> 01:23:06.972
- It's all right.


01:23:07.014 --> 01:23:08.982
- Join me?


01:23:26.100 --> 01:23:30.196
Last night, He Who Walks Behind
The Rows spoke to me in a dream,


01:23:30.237 --> 01:23:32.933
and I did fall down
upon my knees in fright


01:23:32.973 --> 01:23:37.273
and hide my eyes lest the terror
of his face strike me dead.


01:23:37.311 --> 01:23:41.748
He is much displeased
with this sacrifice.


01:23:43.717 --> 01:23:47.380
And the Lord did say, "Have I not
given you this place of killing


01:23:47.421 --> 01:23:49.355
so that you might make
sacrifice here?


01:23:49.390 --> 01:23:52.257
Have I not shewn you favor?


01:23:52.292 --> 01:23:54.055
But I did give you a test.


01:23:54.094 --> 01:23:57.461
Two outlanders did come
a man and a woman.


01:23:57.498 --> 01:23:59.966
But this man has made
a blasphemy within me


01:24:00.000 --> 01:24:02.491
and did cause confusion
among you.


01:24:02.536 --> 01:24:04.766
This man was strong
in his evil.


01:24:05.773 --> 01:24:08.970
And so then I've completed
this sacrifice myself


01:24:09.009 --> 01:24:11.807
Iike the blue man who tried
to escape many years ago."


01:24:11.845 --> 01:24:14.473
The blue man.
Yea, the blue man.


01:24:14.515 --> 01:24:17.916
"And so now
the age of favor is lowered


01:24:17.951 --> 01:24:20.215
from 19 planting harvests to 18.


01:24:20.254 --> 01:24:24.054
Each and every one of you will walk
into the corn at dusk


01:24:24.091 --> 01:24:26.286
upon your 18th birthday


01:24:26.326 --> 01:24:30.092
and He Who Walks Behind
The Rows will find you,


01:24:30.130 --> 01:24:32.064
and you will walk with him."


01:24:32.099 --> 01:24:34.829
So the Lord told me.


01:24:42.976 --> 01:24:46.275
I obey the word of God.


01:24:50.417 --> 01:24:53.477
- Praise God!
- Praise God.


01:24:53.520 --> 01:24:57.183
May the favor of He Who Walks
Behind The Rows be shewn


01:24:57.224 --> 01:25:00.057
- and be upon you.
- Amen.


01:25:54.748 --> 01:25:57.342
Scarecrow!


01:29:58.892 --> 01:30:01.122
Never mind.


01:30:02.496 --> 01:30:04.157
If it is God's will,


01:30:04.197 --> 01:30:08.258
the children will continue on
as always, Ruth.


01:30:09.403 --> 01:30:12.304
If it's God's will, yes.


01:30:13.473 --> 01:30:15.134
Then why do you fear?


01:30:15.175 --> 01:30:17.837
- I fear nothing.
- Please, Malachai.


01:30:17.878 --> 01:30:19.743
I obey the will of God.


01:30:19.780 --> 01:30:23.443
My birthday will come
in October after the harvest.


01:30:23.483 --> 01:30:26.316
I barely lose one month.


01:30:26.353 --> 01:30:29.516
Amos is losing almost
his entire 18th year.


01:30:29.556 --> 01:30:33.322
If this is the will of God,
I wish there were no God!


01:30:33.360 --> 01:30:35.726
Do not blaspheme!


01:30:46.706 --> 01:30:50.107
Have a fine son, Ruth,


01:30:50.143 --> 01:30:53.203
and raise him to love religion
and to hate the world.


01:30:57.884 --> 01:31:00.318
Promise me.


01:31:00.353 --> 01:31:03.117
I I can't.


01:31:23.677 --> 01:31:26.271
It's night now.


01:31:28.982 --> 01:31:31.212
His time.


01:31:32.452 --> 01:31:35.080
I know, Amos.


01:31:38.525 --> 01:31:41.221
Goodbye, Malachai.

